@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

hide footbox
title SSD: US013 - To get all official genres list

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

    User -> System : I want to see aal official genres in the system,
    activate System

    System --> User : Here's the list of available genres!
    deactivate System

deactivate User
@enduml